{"id":10332,"slug":"10332-khi-nao-dung-change-va-khi-nao-can-viet-up-down-rieng-trong-migration","category":"Rails","subcategory":"Migration & DB","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"Khi nào dùng `change` và khi nào cần viết `up`/`down` riêng trong migration?","question_en":"When should you use `change` vs. separate `up`/`down` in a migration?","answer_vi":"`change` dùng cho các operations **tự reversible** — Rails biết cách đảo ngược:\n\n```ruby\ndef change\n  add_column :users, :age, :integer   # down: remove_column\n  add_index :users, :email             # down: remove_index\n  create_table :posts do |t| ... end  # down: drop_table\nend\n```\n\nMột số operations **không reversible** → phải viết `up`/`down` rõ ràng:\n\n```ruby\ndef up\n  execute \"UPDATE users SET role = 'member' WHERE role IS NULL\"\nend\n\ndef down\n  raise ActiveRecord::IrreversibleMigration,\n    \"Cannot reverse a data-only migration\"\nend\n```\n\nOperations không reversible: `remove_column` (mất data type), `change_column`, `execute` raw SQL data.","answer_en":"Use `change` for operations that are **inherently reversible** — Rails knows how to invert them:\n\n```ruby\ndef change\n  add_column :users, :age, :integer   # down: remove_column\n  add_index :users, :email             # down: remove_index\n  create_table :posts do |t| ... end  # down: drop_table\nend\n```\n\nSome operations are **not reversible** — write explicit `up`/`down`:\n\n```ruby\ndef up\n  execute \"UPDATE users SET role = 'member' WHERE role IS NULL\"\nend\n\ndef down\n  raise ActiveRecord::IrreversibleMigration,\n    \"Cannot reverse a data-only migration\"\nend\n```\n\nNon-reversible operations: `remove_column` (loses type info), `change_column`, raw SQL data mutations.","answer_html_vi":"<p><code>change</code> dùng cho các operations <strong>tự reversible</strong> — Rails biết cách đảo ngược:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">ruby</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"def change\n  add_column :users, :age, :integer   # down: remove_column\n  add_index :users, :email             # down: remove_index\n  create_table :posts do |t| ... end  # down: drop_table\nend\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">change</span>\n  add_column <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">:users</span>, <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">:age</span>, <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">:integer</span>   <span class=\"hljs-comment\"># down: remove_column</span>\n  add_index <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">:users</span>, <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">:email</span>             <span class=\"hljs-comment\"># down: remove_index</span>\n  create_table <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">:posts</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">do</span> |<span class=\"hljs-params\">t</span>| ... <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">end</span>  <span class=\"hljs-comment\"># down: drop_table</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">end</span></code></pre></div><p>Một số operations <strong>không reversible</strong> → phải viết <code>up</code>/<code>down</code> rõ ràng:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">ruby</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"def up\n  execute &quot;UPDATE users SET role = 'member' WHERE role IS NULL&quot;\nend\n\ndef down\n  raise ActiveRecord::IrreversibleMigration,\n    &quot;Cannot reverse a data-only migration&quot;\nend\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">up</span>\n  execute <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;UPDATE users SET role = &#x27;member&#x27; WHERE role IS NULL&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">end</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">down</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">raise</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ActiveRecord</span><span class=\"hljs-symbol\">:</span><span class=\"hljs-symbol\">:IrreversibleMigration</span>,\n    <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Cannot reverse a data-only migration&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">end</span></code></pre></div><p>Operations không reversible: <code>remove_column</code> (mất data type), <code>change_column</code>, <code>execute</code> raw SQL data.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p>Use <code>change</code> for operations that are <strong>inherently reversible</strong> — Rails knows how to invert 