>down</code>:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">ruby</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"def up\n  execute &quot;UPDATE users SET role = 'member' WHERE role IS NULL&quot;\nend\n\ndef down\n  raise ActiveRecord::IrreversibleMigration,\n    &quot;Cannot reverse a data-only migration&quot;\nend\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">up</span>\n  execute <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;UPDATE users SET role = &#x27;member&#x27; WHERE role IS NULL&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">end</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">down</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">raise</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ActiveRecord</span><span class=\"hljs-symbol\">:</span><span class=\"hljs-symbol\">:IrreversibleMigration</span>,\n    <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Cannot reverse a data-only migration&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">end</span></code></pre></div><p>Non-reversible operations: <code>remove_column</code> (loses type info), <code>change_column</code>, raw SQL data mutations.</p>","references":[{"label":"Rails Guides — Active Record Migrations (Reversible)","url":"https://guides.rubyonrails.org/active_record_migrations.html#using-the-change-method"},{"label":"Viblo — Các câu hỏi phỏng vấn Rails Developer Phần 2","url":"https://viblo.asia/p/cac-cau-hoi-phong-van-ruby-on-rails-developer-phan-2-ByEZkOR2ZQ0"}],"related":[{"url":"/q/10330-migrations-trong-rails-la-gi-tai-sao-can-dung-thay-vi-viet-sql-truc-tiep","title":"Migrations trong Rails là gì? Tại sao cần dùng thay vì viết SQL trực tiếp?"},{"url":"/q/10331-db-schema-rb-la-gi-khac-gi-voi-cac-migration-files","title":"`db/schema.rb` là gì? Khác gì với các migration files?"},{"url":"/q/10333-index-trong-db-la-gi-va-rails-them-index-nhu-the-nao-trong-migration","title":"Index trong DB là gì và Rails thêm index như thế nào trong migration?"},{"url":"/q/10334-lam-the-nao-de-viet-migration-an-toan-tren-production-db-lon-zero-downtime","title":"Làm thế nào để viết migration an toàn trên production DB lớn (zero-downtime)?"},{"url":"/q/10300-ruby-on-rails-la-gi-triet-ly-thiet-ke-cot-loi-cua-framework-la-gi","title":"Ruby on Rails là gì? Triết lý thiết kế cốt lõi của framework là gì?"},{"url":"/q/10301-giai-thich-kien-truc-mvc-trong-rails","title":"Giải thích kiến trúc MVC trong Rails."},{"url":"/q/10302-cau-truc-thu-muc-cua-mot-rails-app-chuan-trong-nhu-the-nao","title":"Cấu trúc thư mục của một Rails app chuẩn trông như thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/10303-gem-la-gi-trong-he-sinh-thai-ruby-rails","title":"Gem là gì trong hệ sinh thái Ruby/Rails?"}]}